Maybe its just me....... but I am sick of righteous indignation.

Lemme see now:

- Mulroney left debt to GDP so high that the IMF forced Chretien and Martin to end deficits and improve the ratio or Canadian debt would be downgraded (in the days of high interest rates already);

- Chretien and Martin eliminated federal deficits and paid off $100 billion of federal debt;

- Harper ran deficits almost every single year tha he was in power and added $160 billion to federal debt

I'm for the Liberals staying in power and  getting growth going again after Harper stalled the economy with his poor decisions on fossil fuels, tax cuts and spending cuts.

